  "decision_conditions": [
    "By reason of excessive depth and scale, the proposed side/rear extension would create a dominant and disproportionate addition that would detract from the character and appearance of the host dwelling and immediate area thereby conflicting with Paragraph 135 of the NPPF (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021, policy DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012 and Policy Guidance 33 in the Residential Design SPD 2013.\r",
    "The proposed alterations to the garage, given increase in height, mass and bulk and the proposed roof form and design, would not be in-keeping with the host dwelling and the adjoining properties within the surrounding area, adversely affecting their cohesive appearance and resulting in an unacceptable impact on the existing street scene, contrary to Paragraph 135 of the NPPF (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021, policy DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012 and Policy Guidance 35 in the Residential Design SPD 2013.\r"
  ],
